{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E] [Am],        lauta do
[Am],        Woh mera pyaar mera dard mujhe
[E] [Am],        lauta do
[Am] [G],        Neend jitni bhi maine khoyi hai
[F] [Am],        Chain jitna bhi maine khoya hai
[Am],        Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E] [Am],        lauta do.....
[Am] [E] [Am],        Ek masum dil hai aur sitam hain kitne
[Am] [E] [Am],        Is mohabbat ke siwa aur bhi gam hai kitne
[G] [Am],        Is mohabbat ke siwa aur bhi gam hai kitne
[Am] [E] [F] [Am],        Mere ishq ka imtehan yun na lo
[Am] [E] [F] [Am],        Tumhein hai kasam meri jaan yun na lo
[Am] [G],        Khwaab jitne bhi maine dekhe hain
[F] [Am],        Yaad jitna kiya hai maine tujhe
[Am],        Woh mere khwaab meri yaad mujhe
[E] [Am],        lauta do
[Am] [E] [Am],        Yeh meri bhul thi jo maine tuze pyar kiya
[Am] [E] [Am],        Na milne waali mohabbat ka intezar kiya
[G] [Am],        Na milne waali mohabbat ka intezar kiya
[Am] [E] [F] [Am],        Yeh kya rang laayi hai meri wafa
[Am] [E] [F] [Am],        Mili hai mujhe kis liye yeh saza
[Am] [G],        Teri chahat ki pyaas thi mujhko
[F] [G],        Tujhko paane ki thi ummeed mujhe
[Am],        Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E] [Am],        Lauta DO......
